                        <span>Sorrow found me when I was young, sorrow waited, sorrow won...</span>
                    </div>

                    <p>We're here now. She's still asleep in the passenger seat as I write this. The streetlights are painting yellow stripes across the dashboard. I should wake her up. We should go inside. But I think I'll let the silence last a little longer. This silence is different. It's not heavy. It's just... quiet.</p>
